      "config": {
        "content": "## The Ghost of Christmas Past\nSanta is preparing the 2026 delivery run. Compare the **2026 plan in Elasticsearch** with **2025 deliveries read directly from Parquet in MinIO**, then join both sources to inspect toy-train exposure.\n\nA delivery is late when `delay_minutes > 0`."
      }
